sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Session as AgentSession
    participant Detector as Background detector
    participant Model as Detector model
    participant Agent as Main agent
    participant Tool as compress_context
    participant History as Session history
    participant UI as TUI

    User->>Session: Send message
    Session->>History: Persist user message and entry ID
    opt Detection model configured and threshold reached
        Note over Session,Detector: +5 context percentage points or 10 new user/tool-result messages
        Session->>Detector: Check active context and entry IDs
        activate Detector
        Detector->>Model: Request CONTINUE or COMPRESS with optional range
        Model-->>Detector: Verdict or read-only tool call
        opt Verify facts or cut points
            Detector->>History: session_search / session_entry_get (read-only, bounded)
            History-->>Detector: Matching entries
            Detector->>Model: Continue decision with lookup results
            Model-->>Detector: Verdict or another bounded lookup
        end
        opt COMPRESS range missing or invalid
            Detector->>History: Validate against current active branch
            History-->>Detector: Validation reason and current IDs
            Detector->>Model: One corrective request
        end
        Model-->>Detector: Final verdict
        Detector-->>Session: CONTINUE or COMPRESS with optional valid range
        deactivate Detector
        opt Verdict is COMPRESS
            alt During active run
                Session->>Agent: Queue advisory as steering for next turn
            else Idle or before first request
                Session->>Agent: Include advisory in next model request
            end
        end
        Note over Session,Agent: Agent waits for detector before its next model request
    end

    Session->>Agent: Continue with context and model-only entry IDs
    alt Agent decides to compress
        Agent->>Tool: startEntryId, optional endEntryId, agent-written summary
        activate Tool
        Tool->>History: Validate active range, at least two messages, complete tool calls
        alt Invalid range
            History-->>Tool: Validation error
            Tool-->>Agent: Reject request
        else Valid range
            History-->>Tool: Validated range
            Tool-->>Agent: Schedule replacement
            Session->>History: Persist tool call and result on original branch
            Session->>History: Branch before startEntryId and append summary
            opt Bounded range with endEntryId
                Session->>History: Replay later suffix with new entry IDs
            end
            History-->>Session: Rebuilt active context (prefix + summary + suffix)
            Session-->>UI: Refresh transcript and utilization
            Session-->>Agent: Continue with rebuilt context
            Note over History,Agent: Originals remain archived and searchable. Detector never compresses automatically.
        end
        deactivate Tool
    else Agent continues without compression
        Agent-->>User: Continue work
    end
